org-invite-subject = You have been invited to { $org_name }
org-invite-body =
    { $inviter_name } has invited you to join { $org_name } on
    { $base_url }. To accept, visit:
    { $accept_url }

    Invitation issuance lands in the admin layer; this template ships
    with password-auth so the embedded fluent loader is complete from
    the start.
